agent-power-manager source package
==================================

This is a native Debian source package. Build it with:

    dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b

The build requires Go 1.26.0 or later and downloads the modules locked by
`go.mod` and `go.sum`. It uses the standard Go network configuration, so an
operator may set `GOPROXY` when selecting an approved module proxy. The build
uses `GOTOOLCHAIN=local`, `-mod=readonly`, and `go mod verify`; it neither
changes dependency lock files nor downloads a replacement Go toolchain.

The package build places all Go download and compiler caches in
`debian/.build`. `debian/rules clean` removes only that build directory and
debhelper-managed output. Default builds run `go test ./...`; an explicit
`DEB_BUILD_OPTIONS=nocheck` skips that test target.
